sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Auth API
    participant D as Credential Store
    C->>A: Present refresh token R1
    A->>D: Validate R1 is active and unexpired
    D-->>A: R1 valid
    A->>D: Atomically revoke R1 and create R2
    D-->>A: Rotation committed
    A-->>C: New access token + R2
    C->>A: Later reuse R1
    A->>D: Detect R1 already consumed
    D-->>A: Reuse detected
    Note over A,D: Apply documented token-family/session revocation policy
    A-->>C: Reject; require reauthentication as policy dictates
